WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,410
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:05,954
Remy wants to put a box inside Sammy, but Sammy is locked!

3
00:00:05,954 --> 00:00:09,518
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:09,518 --> 00:00:11,634
This is Episode 40.

5
00:00:11,634 --> 00:00:14,123
Remy is only visiting today.

6
00:00:14,123 --> 00:00:16,568
Maya could give him a name tag.

7
00:00:16,568 --> 00:00:19,342
But a name tag lasts forever.

8
00:00:19,342 --> 00:00:22,204
Remy is only here until sunset.

9
00:00:22,204 --> 00:00:25,548
So Maya gives him a sunset pass instead.

10
00:00:25,548 --> 00:00:27,346
She sticks it on.

11
00:00:27,346 --> 00:00:28,509
Click!

12
00:00:28,509 --> 00:00:30,296
Sammy opens.

13
00:00:30,296 --> 00:00:32,807
Remy puts his box inside.

14
00:00:32,807 --> 00:00:33,969
Click!

15
00:00:33,969 --> 00:00:35,669
Sammy locks.

16
00:00:35,669 --> 00:00:37,610
The sun goes down.

17
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,910
The pass fades and peels off by itself.

18
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,610
It floats away.

19
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:44,901
Nobody had to take it back.

20
00:00:44,901 --> 00:00:47,160
The badge is who you become.

21
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:49,792
The pass is how long it lasts.

22
00:00:49,792 --> 00:00:52,039
That is the sunset pass.

23
00:00:52,039 --> 00:00:54,232
Now you know STS!

24
00:00:54,232 --> 00:00:58,103
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

